From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:31:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 206/210] v4l2codecs: Add AVS1/AVS+ decoder

Add v4l2slavsdec, a stateless decoder for AVS1 (JiZhun profile) and
AVS+ (Guangdian profile) video for devices that take the
V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME coded format, such as the AVS+ decoder of the
Rockchip RK3588 (hantro).

Each picture is passed whole, from its picture start code to the end
of its last slice, with the AVS_SEQUENCE and AVS_PICTURE controls and,
for AVS+ pictures with weighting quantization, the AVS_WEIGHT_QUANT
control. Streams of the pre-final revision of the standard have no
slice start codes; their slice data follows the picture header.

Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecavsdec.c | 1042 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
